    <!-- Tour Overview Section -->
    <section class="tour-overview-section">
      <div class="page-content">
        <h2 class="tour-main-title">OVERVIEW</h2>
        <p class="tour-description">
          Immerse yourself in the world's most vibrant cultural celebrations
          with our Festival Getaways - where travel becomes an extraordinary
          journey into the heart of local traditions, music, and communal joy.
          Experience the electrifying energy of Ghana's Homowo Festival as
          communities gather to celebrate the harvest with traditional drumming
          and dancing. Join the spectacular Chale Wote Street Art Festival in
          Accra, where contemporary African art transforms the city into an
          open-air gallery. Witness the spiritual fervor of Ethiopia's Timkat
          celebration, a breathtaking Epiphany festival that fills the streets
          of Addis Ababa with colorful processions and ancient rituals. Dance to
          the rhythms at Morocco's Fes Festival of World Sacred Music, where
          spiritual melodies from around the globe create an atmosphere of
          transcendental harmony. Experience the magic of Dubai Shopping
          Festival, where entertainment, culture, and commerce converge in a
          month-long celebration. From the Lamu Cultural Festival's traditional
          dhow races to the Cape Town International Jazz Festival's world-class
          performances, our festival getaways offer unparalleled access to
          events that define destinations. These carefully timed journeys
          provide more than sightseeing - they offer transformational
          experiences that connect you deeply with local communities and their
          most cherished traditions. With insider access to festival venues,
          priority bookings, and expert guides who understand the cultural
          significance of each celebration, you'll not just watch the
          festivities - you'll become part of them.
        </p>

